\par \pard\li175 \b\cf1 Standard\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 enhances image detection with increased magnification and multi-particle detection; this category includes all Standard Sensors, the Crystal Matrix and the Advanced Crystal Matrix Sensors.
\par \b Scout\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 advanced equipment with the Sensei or Shadow\'92s signal-dampened chassis allows far greater detection; this category includes all Scout and Scout Crystal Matrix Sensors.
\par 
\par Each Sensor is rated three ways: 
\par Range Maximum \'96 the maximum number of hexes of visibility the system offers.
\par \pard\li175 Indirect Visibility Capability \'96 the overall ability of the sensor to see objects that are not in direct line of sight. P = Poor; G = Good.
\par Energy Used Per Turn \'96 the amount of reactor power required to set the Sensor at the beginning of each turn.
\par 
